      "description": "## 🔄 Get Business Entitlements Limits Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Search for Business Entity | (Optional) Use this step if the institutionCustomerId is not already known. Retrieve business user details and match the memberNumber (TIN/EIN) to identify the corresponding institutionCustomerId. This step can also be used to locate the associated businessId. |\n| 3a | \\[Option 1\\] Get Business Entitlements Limits - Business ID | Retrieve all entitled features and associated limits for the specified business. |\n| 3b | \\[Option 2\\] Get Business Entitlements Limits - Institution Customer ID | Retrieve entitled features and associated limits for a specific business location identified by institutionCustomerId. |\n| 3c | \\[Option 3\\] Get Business Entitlements Limits - Feature Name | Retrieve entitled features and associated limits filtered by a specific feature. Set `business_feature_name` to one of the following values: ACH Payments, ACH Collections, Wires - Domestic, Bill Pay, or Zelle. |\n| 3d | \\[Option 4\\] Get Business Entitlements Limits - Institution Customer ID & Feature Name | Retrieve entitled features and associated limits for a specific business location and feature. |"
